@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Use your EXISTING API's port in baseUrl.
### Normal input
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sql-injection-test/unsafe?name=Alice

### Same normal input, parameterized
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sql-injection-test/safe?name=Alice

### Unsafe tautology (all three rows)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sql-injection-test/unsafe?name=%27%20OR%201%3D1%20--

### Unsafe stacked SELECT: two result sets
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sql-injection-test/unsafe?name=Alice%27%3B%20SELECT%20Id%2C%20Name%20FROM%20%5BSQLInjectionTest%5D.%5BUsers%5D%3B%20--

### Unsafe stacked DROP TABLE: lab disposable table only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sql-injection-test/unsafe?name=Alice%27%3B%20DROP%20TABLE%20%5BSQLInjectionTest%5D.%5BDisposable%5D%3B%20--

### Reset the disposable lab tables
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sql-injection-test/reset
